      "The Other One → Stella Blue → Sugar Magnolia suite – a high‑energy second‑set climax."
    ],
    "band_performance": {
      "Jerry": "Fiery, crystal‑clear tone on Peggy‑O and Estimated Prophet; strong vocals on Tennessee Jed and solid rhythm work throughout, with an especially inspired solo on Sugaree.",
      "Phil": "Bass sits perfectly in the mix – punchy, inventive and anchors the improvisations, particularly during The Other One and Stella Blue.",
      "Bob": "Vocals range from a slightly slurred delivery early on to powerful moments on Estimated Prophet; adds memorable vocal shouts during The Other One.",
      "Keys": "Brent Mydland’s keyboards lock in tightly with Garcia, providing professional, consummate texture that lifts Bird Song and the second‑set jams.",
      "Drums": "Bill Kreutzmann and Mickey Hart deliver crisp, powerful drumming; their tight foundation is highlighted throughout, especially during the high‑energy transitions into The Other One."
